WEBVTT

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.360
This video covers reviewing a
draft on iPhone: checking it

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:07.030
against the recording, correcting
it, and finishing your review.

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:09.510
Open the encounter and
switch to Transcript.

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:12.070
Tap a passage to play the
audio from that moment.

00:00:12.693 --> 00:00:14.853
Here, the note says Mochi's
weight was stable, but

00:00:14.853 --> 00:00:17.413
the transcript says it's
up a little since Tuesday.

00:00:17.413 --> 00:00:19.723
Tap Edit and fix the wording.

00:00:19.893 --> 00:00:21.893
The keyboard bar adds bold,

00:00:21.893 --> 00:00:24.603
italics, headings, and lists.

00:00:24.693 --> 00:00:27.563
Use Preview to check the
result, then tap Save.

00:00:28.047 --> 00:00:30.197
Saving doesn't complete the encounter.

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:33.087
When your review is finished,
tap the arrow beside

00:00:33.087 --> 00:00:36.197
Send and Complete, then
choose Mark as complete.

00:00:36.367 --> 00:00:38.597
Full screen reading is
available on the web.
